        "r": 556.0200000000001,
        "b": 720.8612344167462
      },
      "content": "The microwave combination oven is designed to protect the user from all hazards that can reasonably be avoided by design measures.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_200",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_200",
          "title": "General rules for dealing with hazards and safety precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 13,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0172",
      "reading_order": 202,
      "section": "General rules for dealing with hazards and safety precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.99100000000004,
        "t": 716.7089195312501,
        "r": 558.4122,
        "b": 684.1412344167462
      },
      "content": "The actual purpose of the microwave combination oven, however, means that there are still residual risks; you must therefore take precautions to avoid them. A safety device can provide you with a certain degree of protection against some of these hazards. You must ensure, however, that these safety devices are in place and in working order.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_200",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_200",
          "title": "General rules for dealing with hazards and safety precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 13,
