        "r": 319.7070000000001,
        "b": 471.62433441674625
      },
      "content": "The microwave combination oven becomes hot inside the cavity and on the inside of the appliance door. This poses a risk of burns on hot surfaces inside the microwave combination oven, and also on hot appliance parts, food containers and other accessories used for cooking.",
